---
import Img from "./Img.astro";
import equipe from "../assets/equipe-completa.jpg";
import simone from "../assets/simone.jpg";
import Anchor from "./Anchor.astro";
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
---

<!-- Opens with a line from the testimonial video (Simone, Beatriz's aunt,
     at ~1:48; "paciente" dropped for flow), which leads into the section's
     theme, the family. Its link scrolls to the video and starts it
     (HeroCro's script handles data-play-testimonial). -->
<Anchor id="intro" />
<!-- The quote on its own full-width band, so it reads as a pause
     between the hero and the About text rather than a second heading. It
     continues the hero's bottom edge (its colour, #fbf8f0, and the same
     grain), so the two join without a seam, then fades into white. -->
<div class="relative bg-linear-to-b from-[#fbf8f0] from-55% to-white px-7.5 pt-12 pb-[46px] md:pt-16 md:pb-[57px]">
  <div aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07] mix-blend-multiply [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_55%,transparent)] bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20width=%22200%22%20height=%22200%22%3E%3Cfilter%20id=%22n%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence%20type=%22fractalNoise%22%20baseFrequency=%220.9%22%20numOctaves=%223%22%20stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect%20width=%22100%25%22%20height=%22100%25%22%20filter=%22url(%23n)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E')]">
  </div>
  <!-- Same left edge as the container below (1300px minus its 30px padding). -->
  <figure class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1240px]">
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="block h-9 md:h-11 text-7xl md:text-8xl font-bold leading-none text-[darkgoldenrod]">“</span>
    <blockquote class="max-w-4xl text-[27px] md:text-[38px] italic leading-snug text-[#393939]">
      É carinho, atenção, uma empatia enorme, tanto com a pessoa que necessita{" "}
      <strong class="font-bold text-[#242424]">quanto com a família.</strong>
    </blockquote>
    <!-- Simone's photo is a still from the video (0:06). The link uses the
         hero's "Assistir vídeo" play icon, in gold, so it doesn't compete
         with the quote. -->
    <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4">
      <Img src={simone} width={56} densities={[1, 2, 3]} alt="Simone, tia da Beatriz"
        class="size-14 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-white shadow-md" />
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[darkgoldenrod]">Simone, tia da Beatriz</span>
        <a href="#depoimento" data-play-testimonial
          class="flex w-max items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[darkgoldenrod] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">
          <!-- "circle-play" icon from Lucide (ISC licence) -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="darkgoldenrod"
            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
            <path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z" fill="darkgoldenrod" />
          </svg>
          Assistir ao depoimento
        </a>
      </div>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <SectionTitle class="md:hidden text-2xl font-bold font-poppins mb-5">
    Compreender as necessidades da sua família é a nossa força
  </SectionTitle>
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-10">
    <!-- Hidden on phones: the hero there already shows the team. -->
    <div class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2">
      <Img src={equipe} class="w-full my-5 md:my-0 rounded-md"
        alt="Equipe da Union Neil" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 600px, 45vw" />
    </div>

    <div class="gap-4 flex flex-col md:w-1/2 text-lg">
      <SectionTitle class="hidden md:block text-2xl font-bold">
        Compreender as necessidades da sua família é a nossa força
      </SectionTitle>
      <p>
        Cuidar de quem amamos exige atenção ao detalhe, resposta rápida e competência técnica, e é muito difícil
        fazer isso sozinho. A Union Neil assume esse cuidado com você, no conforto de casa.
      </p>
      <!-- The floating WhatsApp widget appears once this paragraph comes into view. -->
      <p id="whatsapp-widget-start">
        Tudo começa por entender a sua família. Nossas Enfermeiras Gestoras, com mais de 20 anos de experiência,
        conhecem a pessoa cuidada, a rotina da casa e o que é importante para vocês. A partir disso, escolhemos os
        profissionais certos e criamos uma rotina de cuidados única para o seu lar.
      </p>
      <p>
        Depois, elas continuam presentes, acompanhando cada detalhe dos cuidados, para que você volte a se
        concentrar no que realmente importa.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
